5,1,1,talk,Mio,,I want to see where our money is actually going! I'll check the loan transport costs over three seasons and mount-making charges and joiner's rate.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I am worried about our capacity. I will look into the conservation lab staffing and backlog and the composition of the volunteer roster.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shion,,I'll focus on what the public actually wants. I'll examine the weekend head counts across ten seasons and five years of visitor comment slips.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I need to know the physical limits of the space. I'll check the structural survey of the suspended bay and evening hire bookings in the gallery.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
