25,2,1,talk,Mio,,"Oh wow, transport and insurance are eating a third of our installation budget! Also, bespoke mounts are getting way more expensive.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
26,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"It is quite dire. The conservation lab is down to one person, and the backlog is huge. Our volunteers are mostly just town historians.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
27,2,1,talk,Shion,,"Interestingly, people love mechanisms and changing displays. The comments also show that visitors prefer seeing someone actually working in the gallery.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
28,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"The suspended bay has a strict weight limit, and our evening hires mean we can't have open arrangements that are easily damaged.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
29,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"I found that distant lenders often miss shipping cut-offs, and powered displays are failing constantly, requiring frequent roping off.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
30,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Shizue, if powered displays are failing, maybe we should avoid anything with too many electronics?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Shion, if people want to see someone working, perhaps a live demonstration would be a good fit?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Victoria, that aligns perfectly with the comment slips. A ""living"" exhibition would likely draw more repeat visitors.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Mio, if mount costs are rising, we should prioritize exhibitions where objects come with their own supports.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Asuka, and we must be careful with the weight of those supports in the suspended bay.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,3,talk,Mio,,"@Victoria, but if the conservation lab is so backed up, can we even handle a lot of new objects?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Mio, that is exactly my fear. We cannot afford a project that requires heavy stabilization or cleaning right now.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,3,talk,Shion,,"@Shizue, does the paperwork delay apply to all loans, or just the international ones?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion, Shizue mentioned distant institutions, so local loans would be much safer.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Asuka, exactly. Local sources would minimize the risk of a delayed opening.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
